* Hermetic ngspice init for design/.
*
* run_elaborate.sh copies this file into the scratch directory it runs
* ngspice from, so a run does NOT depend on whether $HOME/.spiceinit exists
* (the PDK ships libs.tech/ngspice/install.py, which symlinks one into $HOME;
* a cold-start checkout on a machine where that was never run must still
* elaborate the netlist the same way).
*
* ngbehavior=hsa is the compatibility mode the PDK's own .spiceinit sets, and
* is what its model libraries are written against. Here it IS load-bearing:
* design/vco.spice instantiates the PDK's own npn13G2v, cap_cmim and
* sg13_hv_svaricap subcircuits, whose model cards use HSPICE-style
* constructs (.if/.else inside .subckt, expression-valued .model parameters)
* that ngspice only accepts in this mode.
set ngbehavior=hsa
